    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present this beautifully upgraded waterside duplex apartment situated along the ever-popular Bailick Road. No. 18 Charleston Wharf offers stylish, low-maintenance living with accommodation extending to approximately 88 sqm (947 sqft.).\n\nThe property has benefited from substantial upgrades throughout, including a full repaint, a contemporary new kitchen, new boiler, new windows, new doors and new flooring, creating a modern and comfortable home ready for immediate occupation.\n\nThe accommodation is well appointed and thoughtfully laid out, comprising an entrance hall, two bedrooms, a main bathroom and ensuite on the entrance level, with a bright and spacious open plan living, kitchen and dining area on the upper level.\n\nThe apartment enjoys an abundance of natural light throughout, with the living space further enhanced by access to a generous balcony where stunning views over the estuary can be enjoyed, along with another balcony on the roadside. The combination of quality upgrades, tasteful finishes and the waterside setting creates a truly special home.\n\nFor those seeking convenient, low-maintenance living in a desirable location, No. 18 Charleston Wharf is an excellent opportunity. The property also benefits from its own designated parking space.\n\nCharleston Wharf is ideally positioned within walking distance of Midleton town centre, where a wide range of shops, restaurants, cafés, schools and amenities are available. The property also enjoys excellent access to the N25, making Cork City and surrounding areas easily accessible.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the exceptional quality, location and lifestyle this impressive apartment has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.03m x 3.46m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.76m x 2.90m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 1.71m x 2.45m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.00m x 3.45m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.86m x 1.90m\n\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.54m x 3.53m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.22m x 5.12m\n\n\nDining Area - 3.30m x 1.82m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.28m x 2.50m\n\n\nFront Balcony - 5.63m x 1.28m\n\n\nRear Balcony - 5.10m x 1.74m\n\n\n"
      },
